{"info": {"address1": "Ram Ratna House", "address2": "Victoria Mill Compound (Utopia City) Pandurang Budha Karm Marg Worli", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400 013", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 2494 9009", "fax": "91 22 2491 2586", "website": "https://www.rrshramik.com", "industry": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "industryKey": "electrical-equipment-parts", "industryDisp": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Ram Ratna Wires Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells winding wires in India and internationally. It operates through Enamelled Wires and Strips, Copper Tubes and Pipes, and Other segments. The company offers enameled aluminium and copper wires; classic submersible, corona resistant, enamelled aluminium, triple insulated, and parallel winding wires; braided, bonded, corona, and Litz wires; paper-covered magnet wires; bunched and braided flexible and cotton-covered copper conductors, and compacted products; bunched and braided bare copper wires; and nylon coated, self bonding, sole coat AIW, and LITZ wire-bunched enamelled wires. It also provides enamelled copper and aluminium strips; paper-covered and glass fibre covered strips; fibreglass, mica, daglass, and other tape insulated strips; classic submersible flat cables; and crepe kraft paper insulated copper cables. In addition, the company offers copper tubes and pipes, including level wound and pancake coils, straight and medical pipes, and PVC-coated and capillary tubes. Further, it provides MCB coils; water pumps comprising peripheral and centrifugal pumps, float switches, and automatic pressure control; and BLDC motors for air conditioners, hubs, high-volume low-speed fans, submersible pumps, related products, and fabricated components and assemblies. The company's products are used in various applications, such as motors and generators, automotive and mobility, pumps, power and energy infrastructure, consumer appliances, and industrial and renewable applications. It also serves the transmission and distribution industry, original equipment manufacturers, and electrical companies. The company exports its products to various international markets. Ram Ratna Wires Limited was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1025, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mahendrakumar Rameshwarlal Kabra", "age": 68, "title": "Joint MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1957, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 36347000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hemant Mahendrakumar Kabra", "age": 38, "title": "Joint MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1987, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ankit  Kedia", "age": 41, "title": "Independent Director", "yearBorn": 1984, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 995000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hitesh Laxmichand Vaghela", "age": 48, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 200000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Iqbal Singh Saggu", "title": "CFO & Senior VP of Finance", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajeev  Maheshwari", "title": "Senior Vice President of Accounts & Taxation", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Saurabh  Gupta", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sumeet Mahendrakumar Kabra", "age": 43, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1982, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 2, "previousClose": 432.